@block io.writer
purpose write frames to a WAV file
kind    leaf
thread  main
est     S
in      frames Frame[] from=mix:out link=data
fn      open(path, AudioFormat) -> Result<Unit>
fn      close() -> Result<Unit>
use     shared.types
inv     output is a valid little-endian PCM16 or float32 WAV file
inv     header sizes match the number of frames written
